ck07","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"AB12_7175"},"text":"哈哈哈哈"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-sock05","author":"guest-c3df5eeedaec1072","createdAt":"2026-11-14T13:54:01.652Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-9e60ea0c3dfc","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"6430咸鱼"},"text":"这种长袜走路会往下掉吗"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-sock04","author":"guest-167f0466a45fc25f","createdAt":"2026-11-14T13:59:48.091Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-9e60ea0c3dfc","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"emote","src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。"}],"guest":{"name":"uki5676"},"text":"桃子不都长这样吗"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-650d513c5350","author":"guest-87732767a1b4ee16","createdAt":"2026-11-14T13:46:44.048Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-650d513c5350/media/blanket-corner-sketch.webp","alt":"淡蓝针织毯左下角的局部草图：左边横纹边框与右边V形针目之间有一列长环，交界下沿的小凹口和聚拢褶线被红圈圈出。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"3479一颗豆"},"text":"就这个角，老往上缩，看着烦。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-knit01","author":"visitor-sigma-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-14T13:55:53.845Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-650d513c5350","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"就那个小豁口，眼睛还老往那儿跑。确实烦。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-0d8631964a92","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-14T13:40:27.794Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-0d8631964a92/media/pink-paper-cases-night.webp","alt":"不锈钢备物台上从左到右放着浅粉、较深粉和奶白三叠波纹纸托，前景有透明包装袋，后方横放黑笔，右边露出半个纸巾盒。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"收纸托又开始按颜色排了\n这两个粉放一块才看出来不一样"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-paper01","author":"visitor-tau","createdAt":"2026-11-14T13:58:43.302Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-0d8631964a92","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"emote","src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。"}],"text":"收个纸托还要分深粉浅粉，看着都嫌麻烦。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-paper02","author":"guest-736d3be73855a053","createdAt":"2026-11-14T14:01:40.574Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-paper01","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"K2288"},"text":"纸托是什么，怎么这也有人收啊。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-1d47015028ce","author":"guest-5108e44d3bd61251","createdAt":"2026-11-14T13:33:00.850Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-1d47015028ce/media/watch-se-sale-evening.webp","alt":"玄关室内灯下，摊开的左手托着熄屏的铝壳手表和浅色运动表带，后方是旧花纹地砖与一角深蓝门垫。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"27_6798"},"text":"【转让】Apple Watch SE（第二代）\n\n各位零友，出一块 Apple Watch SE 第二代，40 mm GPS，铝金属表壳、运动表带，S/M 码。2024年10月送给老婆的，她玩了两周，之后基本就一直闲置了。需要的话可以再拍细节。\n\n她现在要重新买 AirPods，就想着把这块出了，能补一点是一点。\n\n当时在意大利亚马逊买的，200欧元。想出100欧元，老零友可以商量。亚眠及周边优先当面交，邮寄的话运费自理。\n\n先在这里挂两周，再挂到二手平台。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-a65cc451f8a4","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-14T13:22:21.648Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我在甜品店上班又不等于我会做蛋糕，前台啊。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-front02","author":"guest-40229581a86bd565","createdAt":"2026-11-14T13:25:19.648Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-a65cc451f8a4","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"Mio_8211"},"text":"上个班还得什么都会啊。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-front01","author":"guest-0b56f302fb1cb3cf","createdAt":"2026-11-14T13:52:01.648Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-a65cc451f8a4","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"4895咸鱼"},"text":"那蛋糕上的生日快乐也是后厨写的吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-2864b7fdc0e6","author":"guest-26daf2b783651c4e","createdAt":"2026-11-14T12:38:59.701Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"120_0"},"text":"图片上传后变暗了\n\n刚在别的网站上传了一张图，上传大概一秒后就变暗了很多。是从 Krita 导出的 JPG，Krita 文件里大部分图层都是 Blender 的渲染图。在文件浏览器里看着正常，颜色配置文件也是 sRGB。有什么建议吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-case-krita02","author":"guest-26daf2b783651c4e","createdAt":"2026-11-14T12:51:55.701Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-2864b7fdc0e6","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"120_0"},"text":"改成上传 PNG 后，变暗的问题解决了。不过点击图片没法查看原尺寸。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-08d0c413ebf4","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-14T12:25:19.847Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"刷到有人介绍自己做的Fumlo，一个3D跳台游戏\n一关一关比较短，有藏起来的陷阱，作者还特意说是公平的。\n\n能自己玩，也能局域网联机，最多四个人。第一个世界免费，联机也能玩，后面的内容一次解锁。\n\n第一世界免费有点心动了，藏起来的陷阱还公平，我就想知道怎么个公平法。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-5929d4c1d3c0","author":"guest-446386bc56af93e2","createdAt":"2026-11-14T12:24:38.384Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-5929d4c1d3c0/media/remote-in-slipper.webp","alt":"沙发脚边不平行地放着两只旧灰蓝拖鞋，一支黑色遥控器的上半截从右侧拖鞋鞋口露出来。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"6505kiwi"},"text":"遥控器找到了，在拖鞋里。昨晚把沙发缝都掏了一遍。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-remote02","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-14T12:27:31.384Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-5929d4c1d3c0","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"这拖鞋还带收纳功能。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-remote01","author":"guest-bf05229b6490a067","createdAt":"2026-11-14T12:39:46.384Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-5929d4c1d3c0","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"emote","src":"assets/emotes/l0/disgust.webp","alt":"L0一手捏鼻子，一手向外推。"}],"guest":{"name":"慢半步2862"},"text":"这拖鞋还穿啊？"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-remote03","author":"guest-066c54804f24ada3","createdAt":"2026-11-14T12:42:46.384Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-remote01","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"emote","src":"assets/emotes/l0/guilty.webp","alt":"L0缩着肩膀，双手抓着衣领，眼睛看向一侧。"}],"guest":{"name":"7867uki"},"text":"不敢拍我的了。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-411359d4687c","author":"guest-94d474f430dc7e70","createdAt":"2026-11-14T10:41:21.653Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"4438林檎"},"text":"NDX 控制 TIDAL\n\n大家好\n\n需要找老版 app，还是 Google 商店里更新到最新的 app 就能控制 NDX 播放 TIDAL 无损？\n\n经销商也不确定，不过倒是很愿意卖我一台 NDX2。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-case-ndx02","author":"news-gadgets","createdAt":"2026-11-14T11:27:08.208Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-411359d4687c","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"老款 NDX 是用 Naim App 控制内置的 TIDAL。TIDAL Connect 是另一回事：老 NDX 不支持，NDX2 支持，可以从 TIDAL App 里直接选它播放。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-case-ndx03","author":"guest-94d474f430dc7e70","createdAt":"2026-11-14T11:41:36.208Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-case-ndx02","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"4438林檎"},"text":"这就是我想知道的，谢谢。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-86e1ea8d19ae","author":"guest-78324f514184506c","createdAt":"2026-11-14T10:39:01.167Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"8634毛豆"},"text":"刷到个标题：“别费劲打补丁了：丹佛斯 AK-SM800A 存在多个远程代码执行漏洞。”"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-6e567d92867a","author":"guest-778d657a44c03621","createdAt":"2026-11-14T10:30:39.520Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"小鹿6626"},"text":"一月买的 Steam Deck，到现在加起来可能还没玩够二十小时。每次看见它都想起来自己花了多少钱，烦，准备出了。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-deck01","author":"guest-3ccf31dad8d06e41","createdAt":"2026-11-14T10:31:55.520Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-6e567d92867a","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/okay.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼竖起拇指。","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"Ryo5455"},"text":"不想玩就出了呗，又不是买了就必须每天打卡。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-bf12d647cd73","author":"guest-8a74ef295f1e9426","createdAt":"2026-11-14T10:27:20.980Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"一杯水4097"},"text":"续订的钱扣了，打开还是免费版。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-paid03","author":"guest-a9c3156e1730a723","createdAt":"2026-11-14T10:37:25.980Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-bf12d647cd73","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"aya_1050"},"text":"钱扣了还叫免费版。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-paid01","author":"guest-26d083ff093ac556","createdAt":"2026-11-14T10:51:44.980Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-bf12d647cd73","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"720毛豆"},"text":"原来花了钱也是免费版，那我心里平衡了。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-paid02","author":"guest-8a74ef295f1e9426","createdAt":"2026-11-14T11:38:19.729Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-paid01","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"一杯水4097"},"text":"别幸灾乐祸了，正烦着呢。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-d7a57d0ba436","author":"guest-b0dc25013c09843e","createdAt":"2026-11-14T09:53:19.964Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"拾柒_77"},"text":"看着像是新用户发现可以通过 OsmAnd 改地图了。最后一次编辑已经是两个月前，可能也不会看到更改集讨论里的留言。要是有哪里“明显不对”，我会改掉，不过有些编辑看起来是在试着补上确实存在的新东西（虽然有些名字，可能连 loc_name 都不太合适）。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-c96b5d7aceb7","author":"guest-cccfae981d890e10","createdAt":"2026-11-14T08:09:15.477Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-c96b5d7aceb7/media/coasters-on-sofa.webp","alt":"左手捏着一个藏蓝交叉绣杯垫，浅灰沙发上另放着斜纹正面和黑色背面朝上的两个杯垫。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"阿佑_2119"},"text":"做好了，也用不上。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-original-coaster01","author":"guest-c0d7e328836d1ddb","createdAt":"2026-11-14T12:18:46.477Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-c96b5d7aceb7","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"2207毛豆"},"text":"翻过去那个黑的还好看点，白线一多看着乱。"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-16be96458cf8","author":"guest-1328616410702459","createdAt":"2026-11-14T06:17:56.092Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-16be96458cf8/media/film-2026-bicycle.webp","alt":"略偏粉的彩色照片，一辆自行车停在灰绿色铁栏杆旁。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-16be96458cf8/media/film-2026-sheet.webp","alt":"略偏粉的竖幅彩色照片，住宅外墙前晾着一条浅色床单，树枝伸进一角。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-16be96458cf8/media/film-school-garden.webp","alt":"黑白照片，一名男子站在菜地里，手拿一把叶菜，抬头看向镜头。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-16be96458cf8/media/film-school-steps.webp","alt":"黑白照片，水泥台阶旁放着一把空折叠椅，栏杆的斜影落在台阶上。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"普通人8964"},"text":"35mm胶片\n\n今年春夏那会儿买了些35mm胶卷，冰箱里还放着几卷没用。隔了30年，想试试再拍胶片。拖到几周前才终于冲洗、扫描，也把高中时拍的一些拿去扫了。\n\n确实得重新学，不过又拍起来还是挺开心的。拨一下过片杆，听见咔哒那声，还是很喜欢。\n\n前两张是今年拍的，后两张是高中时拍的。"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-case-film04","author":"guest-38610876bc62834a","createdAt":"2026-11-14T06:28:45.092Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-16be96458cf8","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"Ryo_7860"},"text":"真不错，尤其喜欢高中拍的那两张黑白，拿来做专辑封面或者印在T恤上都挺合适。我大学时才开始接触摄影，那时还没用上数码，最喜欢的也是黑白。"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-case-film02","author":"visitor-pi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-14T07:31:09.609Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-16be96458cf8","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"太酷了！"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-943ff5cd2e1f","author":"visitor-eta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-14T06:04:35.551Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-943ff5cd2e1f/media/laundry-socks.webp","alt":"洗衣机门口堆着湿床单，一只手正从褶子里拉出深蓝袜子，旁边还露着一截灰袜子。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote"}],"text":"洗完还得从床单里一只只掏袜子，烦。"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-reply-laundry01","author":"guest-34db8a2ad69e8cc1","createdAt":"2026-11-14T06:14:27.551Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-943ff5cd2e1f","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"emote","src":"assets/emotes/l0/disgust.webp","alt":"L0一手捏鼻子，一手向外推。"}],"guest":{"name":"1595点点"},"text":"袜子还跟床单一起洗啊……"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-dcf0dd23fdfb","author":"visitor-psi","createdAt":"2026-11-14T05:45:58.696Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"在别处看到一个写软件的人诉苦，说原来晚上11点就睡，用了两个月AI帮他写代码，反而天天干到半夜1点，人还更累了。\n\n他说自己弄了两年的东西，用上AI以后，现在想自己动手改一点都发怵。这一两个月像把后面一年的活都赶出来了，可后面还是有干不完的活等着，越做越多。当初就是想偷个懒，结果给AI当上监工了。\n\n我看着都累，做得快了还是歇不下来，那省下来的工夫到哪去了。你们用起来也这样吗，我还以为交给它了，人就能少操点心。"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-case-aiwork05","author":"guest-04baeb09de659fbc","createdAt":"2026-11-14T05:47:39.696Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-dcf0dd23fdfb","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"9796一一"},"text":"我觉得主要还是没有回报的问题"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-case-aiwork04","author":"guest-d46ecb2963eaa1ee","createdAt":"2026-11-14T05:48:08.696Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-dcf0dd23fdfb","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"YY9504"},"text":"变成黑客帝国里的人体电池了"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-case-aiwork06","author":"guest-384199f293eab646","createdAt":"2026-11-14T05:49:27.696Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-case-aiwork05","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"七号_4199"},"text":"回报不要想了，我看写代码这事会慢慢贬值，幸好现阶段还能减点负担"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-case-aiwork02","author":"guest-f7194527835e2dbc","createdAt":"2026-11-14T05:55:19.696Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-dcf0dd23fdfb","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"6270kiwi"},"text":"他为什么下班还要干活？"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-case-aiwork03","author":"guest-5e0d7d740b1ad18b","createdAt":"2026-11-14T06:04:42.696Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-dcf0dd23fdfb","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"7510团团"},"text":"AI要都能干好，人还学技术干嘛？我看本来就是替代，现在还需要人指个大方向，以后再发展发展，嘴巴随便说几句就能弄个软件出来，没辙的"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-5c1372a3a114","author":"guest-42b5bb8d105c97f2","createdAt":"2026-11-14T05:20:46.902Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"一颗豆9594"},"text":"我们不喜欢大语言模型的输出，不是因为看不懂。"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-case-llm02","author":"guest-bf213c1b11ba62f7","createdAt":"2026-11-14T05:22:57.902Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-5c1372a3a114","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"一颗豆_3479"},"text":"“我们”指谁？"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-9e240216a95f","author":"guest-20531375e81a7c5f","createdAt":"2026-11-14T05:14:40.594Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"AB126968"},"text":"所以，有人在做《塞尔达传说：时之笛》的语言学习卡组吗？\n\n感觉现在做正是时候。里面有不少古老的词句，很适合拿来学。"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-case-deck02","author":"guest-9d162e4c5eef6dc2","createdAt":"2026-11-14T05:15:41.594Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-9e240216a95f","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"一杯水_3838"},"text":"有句话叫“最好的服务就是自己动手”。我看是时候动手实现你的学习卡组梦想了。"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-a33f5b9fe257","author":"visitor-gamma","createdAt":"2026-11-14T04:37:25.471Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-a33f5b9fe257/media/drawer-angle.webp","alt":"蓝色笔线画出只打开一条窄缝的零件抽屉，一只手斜伸进去够几枚垫圈。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"抽屉就开这么点，拿个垫圈还得把手斜着塞进去。贴新标签有什么用，看着更烦。"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-reply-drawer01","author":"visitor-eta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-14T06:05:12.551Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-a33f5b9fe257","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"拿不出来也怪标签，真行。"},{"id":"l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-old-drawer01","author":"guest-82b2696010371fd2","createdAt":"2026-11-14T07:58:31.609Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-reply-drawer01","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","kind":"emote"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/wait.webp","alt":"L0蹲着，双手托住脸，尾巴向一侧弯起。","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"ququ1300"},"text":"标签干什么了？"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-ff522a4da354","author":"guest-b79158b07facd634","createdAt":"2026-11-14T04:05:29.828Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"ququ_8092"},"text":"无指手套的图解有个地方想问一下，一共起了56针。\n\n我现在织右手这只，按图解起点要错开一针。说明让我标记第31针，但重复花样这里我看糊涂了：6针一个重复，里面的“yo、p2tog tbl”要做4次。\n\n我算着如果照图解织，第一行在该织第31针下针之前，好像会少一针？是我哪里数错了吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-case-mitten02","author":"guest-617e09f6b3e8cfcd","createdAt":"2026-11-14T04:07:33.828Z","replyTo":"l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-ff522a4da354","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"8134Haku"},"text":"你可能是把第31针也算进图解那一段了。\n\n如果右手这段是先1针、6针重复4次，末尾再5针，那就是：\n1＋6×4＋5＝30针\n下一针才是标记的第31针。\n\n如果说明接着是标记针织下针、后面25针织上针，合起来就是30＋1＋25＝56针。按这个数法，标记针前织30针就够了，可以对照一下是不是这里算多了。"}],"thumbnails":{"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114201332-4907a50a-977b78b157dc/media/stubborn-mandarin-peel.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/7102a864f4cf83547eeaaf8efc0a6ca35bfbace31066926c83765ef46746051f.webp","width":240,"height":320},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-9e60ea0c3dfc/media/peach-sock-night.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/d1ce6ddb10faf910903837afecdfc37afd1ee95cdfef9f67ed6170d59dcdd418.webp","width":240,"height":320},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-650d513c5350/media/blanket-corner-sketch.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/cad66f1071a2d7cca10c54b5a4f875b14cc66cf9f9d1c1eeb9595a6a651d49c0.webp","width":320,"height":213},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-0d8631964a92/media/pink-paper-cases-night.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/9b80664b59501313515912c9ff2090d071763214f4cd60c149efecc3547cbbd5.webp","width":240,"height":320},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-1d47015028ce/media/watch-se-sale-evening.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/7d6f2a3a2bf7fffee7564dcf9de90c8933427a572f6e8eaa99b77c1de6ed9794.webp","width":240,"height":320},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-5929d4c1d3c0/media/remote-in-slipper.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/e692000645800afb9055f46fb86181946afb6c66c564050c4510374faef12bb4.webp","width":240,"height":320},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114140248-b86b21ce-c96b5d7aceb7/media/coasters-on-sofa.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/179e5632efa34ad3ee3dad14f0f6ecb808bd72cadd0def54d1b6072e0ec496b8.webp","width":240,"height":320},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-16be96458cf8/media/film-2026-bicycle.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/4979f6f7d293d4c3fc6f8149fffb69096b14f2b15b7c5b301e18df4d1963dd40.webp","width":320,"height":213},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-16be96458cf8/media/film-2026-sheet.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/1fb4d62b7c3f9e677916afaca2fecd8d2609e30deb97c999eceb073d1f39100a.webp","width":213,"height":320},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-16be96458cf8/media/film-school-garden.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/6f08cb53d9eace5675356dbce93e2fe6a97b67779f1bd6c6d4c290b8b890815e.webp","width":320,"height":213},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-16be96458cf8/media/film-school-steps.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/6872db343b2dcbbfb6f99da17122193a381b13c144e07db8c3dcc12fc8939080.webp","width":320,"height":213},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-943ff5cd2e1f/media/laundry-socks.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/a28149c290d0d08f2e5ee5d958fdbc5fc688cf42c8327b7d1b2ed481d7bb50ce.webp","width":320,"height":240},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261114080303-57d99eab-a33f5b9fe257/media/drawer-angle.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/1a05ebc876f17d8fc51c3c3f40db2956580ffbc0d8bfec76fe0bcf2716a35aaf.webp","width":320,"height":240}}}
